#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec01_bookintro/section.rst:9
msgid "Instruction of Beginning MapServer"
msgstr "MapServer入门说明"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec01_bookintro/section.rst:11
msgid ""
"Beginning MapServer: Open source GIS development is the first book of its"
" kind. It provides a comprehensive introduction to MapServer, a "
"development platform that integrates map mapping technology into Internet"
" applications. You will learn how to build and extend dynamic "
"applications using popular languages such as PHP, Perl, and Python. After"
" you have detailed the installation and configuration, you will discover "
"the basic Mapserver themes and examples. You will also learn about "
"advanced MapServer features. How to query dynamic data and incorporate it"
" into your application. This book ends with the creation of an actual map"
" application."
msgstr "《地图服务器入门：开源地理信息系统开发》是此类书籍中的第一本。它全面介绍了MapServer，这是一个将地图制图技术集成到互联网应用程序中的开发平台。您将学习如何使用流行的语言(如PHP、Perl和Python)构建和扩展动态应用程序。在详细介绍安装和配置之后，您将了解基本的MapServer主题和示例。您还将了解高级MapServer功能。如何查询动态数据并将其合并到应用程序中。本书最后介绍了一个实际的地图应用程序的创建。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec01_bookintro/section.rst:22
msgid "The book’s URL: https://www.apress.com/cn/book/9781590594902 ."
msgstr "这本书的网址：https://www.apress.com/cn/book/9781590594902。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec01_bookintro/section.rst:24
msgid "Introduction on Douban Reading: https://book.douban.com/subject/1756263/ ."
msgstr "豆瓣阅读简介：https://book.douban.com/subject/1756263/。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec01_bookintro/section.rst:28
msgid ""
"The code for this book is hosted on Github at https://github.com/Apress"
"/beg-mapserver< /a> . The data and code used in the book can be found in "
"the code base."
msgstr ""
"本书的代码托管在Github上，网址为https://github.com/Apress/beg-"
"mapserver</a>。书中使用的数据和代码可以在代码库中找到。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec01_bookintro/section.rst:33
msgid "Online operating environment"
msgstr "在线运营环境"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec01_bookintro/section.rst:35
msgid ""
"In order to facilitate learning and use, an online running environment is"
" established in this section, and the more complex case configurations in"
" the book are run. The original book was published in 2005. Up to now, "
"MapServer has undergone major changes, and some modifications are "
"inevitable in order to run. In addition, for the convenience of use, some"
" text descriptions will also be added."
msgstr "为了方便学习和使用，本部分建立了在线运行环境，并运行了书中较复杂的案例配置。原著于2005年出版。到目前为止，MapServer已经经历了重大的变化，为了运行，一些修改是不可避免的。此外，为了使用方便，还将添加一些文字说明。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec01_bookintro/section.rst:42
msgid ""
"The first example in the book is relatively simple, modified during the "
"development of the website as an example of the website, and is not "
"repeated here."
msgstr "书中的第一个例子比较简单，在网站开发过程中进行了修改，作为网站的例子，这里不再重复。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:4
msgid "MAP Object"
msgstr "地图对象"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:6
msgid ""
"MAP corresponds to “root” in MapFile, which contains all other objects, "
"and is an application-level MAP-level parameter."
msgstr "Map对应于MapFile中的“根”，它包含所有其他对象，是应用程序级别的映射级参数。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:9
msgid ""
"Some general parameters are listed in the first part, and the detailed "
"parameters are explained in a later section."
msgstr "第一部分列出了一些常规参数，详细参数将在后面的小节中解释。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:13
msgid "General parameter description"
msgstr "一般参数说明"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:16
msgid "Common map settings"
msgstr "常用地图设置"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:18
msgid ""
"NAME: The prefix for generating Map, Scale bar and GIF legend file names,"
" which should be as short as possible. Value: ``[name]`` ."
msgstr "名称：生成地图、比例尺和GIF图例文件名的前缀，应尽可能短。价值：  ``[name]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:20
msgid ""
"UNITS: The unit of map coordinates. Value: "
"``[feet|inches|kilometers|meters|miles|dd]`` ."
msgstr "单位：地图坐标的单位。价值：  ``[feet|inches|kilometers|meters|miles|dd]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:22
msgid ""
"EXTENT: The spatial extent of the map to be created. MapServer can get "
"the corresponding value at runtime, it is recommended to specify the "
"corresponding value. Value: ``[minx] [miny] [maxx] [maxy]``"
msgstr ""
"范围：要创建的地图的空间范围。MapServer可以在运行时获取对应的值，建议指定对应的值。价值：  ``[minx] [miny] [maxx]"
" [maxy]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:25
msgid ""
"STATUS: Whether the ~map is the mark of ~active. When its value is OFF, "
"the corresponding map is used as the base map or scale bar. Value: "
"[on|off]."
msgstr "状态：~图是否为~ACTIVE标志。当其值处于禁用状态时，相应的贴图将用作底图或比例尺。价值： [on|off] 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:28
msgid ""
"FONTSET: The name of the font file (including the path). Either absolute "
"or relative paths can be used. Tip: Values start with a slash ( ``/`` ). "
"Value: ``[path/filename.ext`` ."
msgstr ""
"FONTSET：字体文件的名称(包括路径)。可以使用绝对路径或相对路径。提示：值以斜杠开头(  ``/`` )。价值：  "
"``[path/filename.ext`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:31
msgid ""
"SYMBOLSET: The name of the symbol file (including the path). Either "
"absolute or relative paths can be used. Tip: Values start with a slash ( "
"``/`` ). Value: ``[path/filename.ext]`` ."
msgstr ""
"SYMBOLSET：符号文件的名称(包括路径)。可以使用绝对路径或相对路径。提示：值以斜杠开头(  ``/`` )。价值：  "
"``[path/filename.ext]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:34
msgid ""
"SHAPEPATH: The path of the shapefile or tile. Can be an absolute path or "
"a relative path relative to the current MapFile file."
msgstr "SHAPEPATH：Shapefile或平铺的路径。可以是相对于当前MapFile文件的绝对路径或相对路径。"

