#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:58
msgid "General output (OUTPUT) settings"
msgstr "常规输出(输出)设置"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:60
msgid ""
"IMAGETYPE: ~ output format. Its value must match the NAME value in the "
"user-defined ~OUTPUTORMAT section or correspond to an internally "
"supported format. Value: [gif|png|jpeg|wbmp|gtiff|swf|userdefined]"
msgstr ""
"ImageType：~输出格式。它的值必须与用户定义的~OUTPUTORMAT部分中的Name值匹配，或对应于内部支持的格式。价值： "
"[gif|png|jpeg|wbmp|gtiff|swf|userdefined]"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:63
msgid "SIZE: :sub:`Output`\\ The size of the Map, in pixels. Value: [x] [y]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:64
msgid ""
"RESOLUTION: The number of pixels per inch, its value only affects the "
"scale calculation, the default value is 72. ~value: ~[integer]."
msgstr "分辨率：每英寸像素数，其值只影响比例计算，缺省值为72。~值：~ [integer] 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:66
msgid ""
"WEB: The start tag of the WEB object, the WEB object defines how the WEB "
"interface operates."
msgstr "Web：Web对象的开始标记，Web对象定义Web界面的操作方式。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:68
msgid ""
"QUERYMAP: The start tag of the QUERYMAP object, the QUERYMAP object "
"defines the display effect of the processing (MAP) query results, etc."
msgstr "QUERYMAP：QUERYMAP对象的开始标签，QUERYMAP对象定义处理(地图)查询结果的显示效果等。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:95
msgid ""
"Components: Datum, legend, and scale bar (Reference Map, Legend, Scale "
"Bar)"
msgstr "组件：基准、图例和比例尺(参考地图、图例、比例尺)"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:97
msgid "The following components can be defined in the MapFile file:"
msgstr "可以在MapFile文件中定义以下组件："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:102
msgid "image0"
msgstr "图像0"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:104
msgid "Fig. 1 Eagle eye diagram example"
msgstr "图1鹰眼示意图"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:106
msgid ""
"REFERENCE: The start tag of the Reference Map object ~. ~Reference Map is"
" an eagle eye map that shows the location of the map in the main window."
msgstr "Reference：Reference Map对象的开始标记~。~参考地图是在主窗口中显示地图位置的鹰眼地图。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:109
msgid ""
"LEGEND: The start tag of the Legend object. ~ It defines how the legend "
"is generated. A corresponding legend component is automatically generated"
" for each layer in the ~CLASS pair."
msgstr "图例：图例对象的开始标记。~它定义了图例的生成方式。为~类对中的每个层自动生成相应的图例组件。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:112
msgid ""
"SCALEBAR: The start tag of the Scalebar object. It defines how the map "
"scale toolbar is generated."
msgstr "SCALEBAR：ScaleBar对象的开始标记。它定义了地图比例工具栏的生成方式。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:118
msgid "image1"
msgstr "图像1"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:120
msgid "Scale Bar Toolbar"
msgstr "比例尺工具栏"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:151
msgid "Map definition"
msgstr "地图定义"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:153
msgid ""
"This section includes instructions for projection in the process of "
"generating a map from a layer."
msgstr "本部分包括在从层生成地图的过程中进行投影的说明。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:156
msgid ""
"LAYER: The start identifier of the LAYER object. There should be at least"
" one layer in the MapFile file, the layer is used to generate the map. "
"The order in which the layers are displayed on the map is reversed (first"
" layer on bottom, last layer on top); see the LAYER section for details."
msgstr "Layer：Layer对象的开始标识符。MapFile文件中应该至少有一个层，该层用于生成地图。各层在地图上的显示顺序是颠倒的(底部的第一个层，顶部的最后一个层)；有关详细信息，请参阅层部分。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:161
msgid ""
"PROJECTION: The start identifier of the PROJECTION object. You should "
"define two types of PROJECTION objects. One is the projection of the "
"output image (defined in the Map object) and the other is defined without"
" the Layer. If the projections of your data are all the same, then you "
"don’t need to define any projections unless you want to do a projection "
"transformation."
msgstr "投影：投影对象的起始标识符。您应该定义两种类型的投影对象。一个是输出图像的投影(在Map对象中定义)，另一个是在没有层的情况下定义的。如果数据的投影都是相同的，那么您不需要定义任何投影，除非您想要进行投影转换。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:169
msgid "Rarely used parameters"
msgstr "很少使用的参数"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:171
msgid ""
"CONFIG: ~ Used to configure the location of EPSG files in the ~PROJ.4 "
"library. Using this configuration allows PROJ.4 to use the files you "
"specify. One of the advantages is that you can avoid setting the "
"corresponding environment variables. For example: ``CONFIG PROJ_LIB "
"/tmp/proj/`` . Setting other values will be passed to "
"``CPLSetConfigOption()`` so that you can control the behavior of the GDAL"
" and OGR drivers. Please refer to the GDAL documentation for details. "
"Value: ``[key] [value]``."
msgstr ""
"CONFIG：~用于配置EPSG文件在~PROJ.4库中的位置。使用此配置允许PROJ.4使用您指定的文件。这样做的好处之一是可以避免设置相应的环境变量。例如："
"  ``CONFIG PROJ_LIB /tmp/proj/`` 。设置其他值将传递给  ``CPLSetConfigOption()`` "
"这样您就可以控制GDAL和OGR驱动程序的行为。有关详细信息，请参阅GDAL文档。价值：  ``[key] [value]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:180
msgid ""
"DATAPATTERN:This defines a regular expression to be applied To requests "
"to change DATA parameters via URL requests (i.e. ``map_layername  "
"_data=...`` )。 If a pattern doesn’t exist then web users Can’t monkey "
"with support files via URLs. This allows you to isolate one Application "
"from another if you desire, with the default operation being Very "
"conservative. See also TEMPLATEPATTERN below. Value: [regular expression"
msgstr ""
"DATAPATTERN：它定义一个正则表达式，该正则表达式将应用于通过URL请求更改数据参数的请求(即  ``map_layername  "
"_data=...``  "
").如果模式不存在，那么网络用户就不能通过URL来摆弄支持文件。这允许您根据需要将一个应用程序与另一个应用程序隔离，默认操作非常保守。另请参阅下面的TEMPLATEPATTERN。值：[正则表达式"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:188
msgid ""
"DEBUG: Enable debugging on the MAP object. The detailed information of "
"the system operation will be output to the LOG file specified by the WEB "
"object. See the DEBUG section for details."
msgstr "调试：启用对映射对象的调试。系统操作的详细信息将输出到Web对象指定的日志文件中。有关详细信息，请参阅调试部分。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:192
msgid ""
"IMAGECOLOR: Initialize the color of the map, such as the background "
"color. When transparency is enabled (TRANSPARENT ON), the specified color"
" is applied to transparent areas. Values: ``[r] [g] [b]`` ."
msgstr "IMAGECOLOR：初始化地图的颜色，如背景颜色。启用透明度(启用透明)时，指定的颜色将应用于透明区域。值：  ``[r] [g] [b]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:196
msgid ""
"SACLE: Computed scale of the map. Usually used in programs rather than in"
" MapFile."
msgstr "SACLE：地图的计算比例。通常在程序中使用，而不是在 Mapfile 中使用。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:199
msgid ""
"TEMPLATEPATTERN:This defines a regular expression to be applied to "
"Requests to change TEMPLATE parameters via URL requests (即 "
"``map_layername_template=...`` )。 If a pattern doesn’t exist then web "
"users Can’t monkey with support files via URLs. This allows you to "
"isolate one Application from another if you desire, with the default "
"operation being Very conservative. See also DATAPATTERN above. Value: "
"``[regular expression]``"
msgstr ""
"TEMPLATEPATTERN：它定义一个正则表达式，该正则表达式将应用于通过URL请求(即)更改模板参数的请求  "
"``map_layername_template=...``  "
").如果模式不存在，那么网络用户就不能通过URL来摆弄支持文件。这允许您根据需要将一个应用程序与另一个应用程序隔离，默认操作非常保守。另请参阅上面的DATAPATTERN。价值："
"  ``[regular expression]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:208
msgid "Output format object"
msgstr "输出格式对象"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:210
msgid ""
"Generally consider that when customizing the output format, you need to "
"use the IMAGETYPE keyword, OUTPUTFORMAT object. Set it only if you need "
"to change the default output format, and you should refer to it before "
"setting it:"
msgstr "一般情况下，在定制输出格式时，需要使用ImageType关键字OUTPUTFORMAT对象。仅当您需要更改默认输出格式时才进行设置，设置前应参考："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:215
msgid ""
"The size of the image has a great influence on the performance of the "
"image (the time required to generate the image and transmit the image). "
"The image generated using the 256color mode is smaller than using the RGB"
" mode."
msgstr "图像的大小对图像的性能(生成图像和传输图像所需的时间)有很大的影响。使用256色模式生成的图像比使用RGB模式生成的图像小。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:219
msgid ""
"Depending on the data, you should consider using different color depths. "
"For example, if you are using satellite imagery or aerial imagery, you "
"should use RGB mode to generate images. In this case the image produced "
"using JPEG is much smaller than the image produced using PNG24."
msgstr "根据数据的不同，您应该考虑使用不同的颜色深度。例如，如果使用卫星图像或航空图像，则应使用RGB模式生成图像。在这种情况下，使用JPEG生成的图像比使用PNG24生成的图像小得多。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:224
msgid ""
"When using JPEG output, you can use the QUALITY option to reduce the "
"image size."
msgstr "使用JPEG输出时，可以使用质量选项来减小图像大小。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:226
msgid "Use the GD or AGG image library."
msgstr "使用GD或AGG图像库。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:229
msgid "GD and AGG image library"
msgstr "GD和AGG图像库"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:231
msgid ""
"GD is an open source library for dynamically creating images. GD can "
"create images in PNG, JPEG, GIF and other formats. GD raw support for the"
" generation of GIF images. However, since its acquisition by Unisys, it "
"has informally supported “Graphics Draw”."
msgstr ""
"GD是一个用于动态创建图像的开源库。GD可以创建PNG、JPEG、GIF等格式的图像。支持GRAW生成GIF图像。然而，自被Unisys收购以来，它一直在非正式地支持“Graphics"
" Drawing”。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:236
msgid ""
"Anti-Grain Geometry (AGG) is a high-quality 2D image rendering library "
"developed using C++. It has anti-aliasing and sub-pixel resolution. This "
"allows you to create high-quality images. The MapServer5.0 version and "
"its higher versions support AGG. For the same MapFile, you can use either"
" AGG for rendering or GD."
msgstr "反颗粒几何(AGG)是一个使用C++开发的高质量2D图像渲染库。它具有抗锯齿和亚像素分辨率。这使您可以创建高质量的图像。MapServer5.0及其更高版本支持AGG。对于同一个MapFile，可以使用AGG进行渲染或使用GD进行渲染。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:245
msgid "image2"
msgstr "图像2"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:247
msgid "Fig. 2 Image processed by AGG"
msgstr "图2经AGG处理的图像"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:250
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:252
msgid ""
"A MapFile can define one or more OUTPUTFORMAT objects, and the supported "
"output formats include PNG, GIF, JPEG, GeoTiff, Flash, etc."
msgstr "一个MapFile可以定义一个或多个OUTPUTFORMAT对象，支持的输出格式包括PNG、GIF、JPEG、GeoTiff、Flash等。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:256
msgid ""
"Support for various formats depends on the libraries used when compiling "
"the program. GeoTiff needs the support of GDAL library"
msgstr "对各种格式的支持取决于编译程序时使用的库。GeoTiff需要GDAL库的支持"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:258
msgid "Flash (swf) requires support from the MING library."
msgstr "Flash(SWF)需要明库的支持。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:260
msgid ""
"NAME: The name of the output format used in IMAGETYPE in MapFile. Value: "
"``[name]``."
msgstr "名称：MapFile的ImageType中使用的输出格式的名称。价值：  ``[name]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:263
msgid ""
"DRIVER: Generate the driver name of the output in the corresponding "
"format. If the driver supports multiple formats, the definition of the "
"format is fixed. For example, the driver name for GD may be ``GD/Gif`` , "
"``GD/PNG`` , ``GD/WBMP`` and ``GD/JPEG``; the driver name for Flasf is "
"SWF. GDAL’s driver name is GDAL/GTiff. PNG, JPEG, GIF can be generated "
"using GDAL or GD (GD is more efficient). Value: ``[name]``"
msgstr ""
"驱动程序：生成相应格式的输出驱动程序名称。如果驱动程序支持多种格式，则格式的定义是固定的。例如，GD的驱动程序名称可以是  ``GD/Gif`` "
"，  ``GD/PNG`` ，  ``GD/WBMP`` 和  ``GD/JPEG`` "
"；Flasf的驱动程序名称为SWF。GDAL的驱动程序名称是GDAL/GTiff。可以使用GDAL或GD(GD更高效)生成PNG、JPEG、GIF。价值："
"  ``[name]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:271
msgid ""
"IMAGEMODE: The image mode for generating the output image. Not all non-"
"raster images are the same as Flash. Not all supported formats have all "
"combinations. E.g. GD/GIF only supports PC256."
msgstr "IMAGEMODE：生成输出图像的图像模式。并非所有非栅格图像都与Flash相同。并非所有支持的格式都具有所有组合。例如，GD/GIF只支持PC256。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:275
msgid ""
"PC256: ~ Generates a false-color image using ~256 colors (MapServer’s "
"legacy mode)"
msgstr "PC256：~使用~256色(MapServer的传统模式)生成假彩色图像"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:277
msgid ""
"RGB: Renders the image in 24-bit Reb/Green/Blue mode. All colors are "
"supported but transparency is not supported."
msgstr "RGB：以24位REB/绿色/蓝色模式渲染图像。支持所有颜色，但不支持透明度。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:279
msgid ""
"RGBA: Renders the image in 24-bit Reb/Green/Blue/Alpha mode. All colors "
"are supported and transparency is supported."
msgstr "RGBA：以24位REB/绿色/蓝色/Alpha模式渲染图像。支持所有颜色，并支持透明度。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:281
msgid ""
"INT16: Render single-band data with 16 as an Integer (integer) bit depth."
" Currently only valid for raster imagery and WMS layers using GDAL."
msgstr "INT16：使用16作为整数位深度来呈现单频带数据。目前仅对使用GDAL的栅格图像和WMS层有效。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:284
msgid ""
"FLOAT32: ~Renders single-band data with a Float (float) bit depth of ~32."
"  Currently only valid for raster images and WMS layers using GDAL. "
"Value: [PC256/RGB/RGBA/INT16/FLOAT32]"
msgstr ""
"FLOAT32：~呈现浮点(FLOAT)位深度为~32的单带数据。目前仅对使用GDAL的栅格图像和wms层有效。价值： "
"[PC256/RGB/RGBA/INT16/FLOAT32]"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:288
msgid ""
"MIMETYPE: the MIME type used by the data returned to the client through "
"the network. Value: ``[type]`` 。"
msgstr "MIMETYPE：通过网络返回给客户端的数据所使用的MIME类型。价值：  ``[type]`` 那就是。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:300
msgid ""
"EXTENSION: generates suffixes for files of the corresponding file type, "
"such as .png, .gif, etc. Value: ``[type]`` ."
msgstr "扩展名：为相应文件类型的文件生成后缀，如.png、.gif等。值：  ``[type]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:303
msgid ""
"TRANSPARENT: use this parameter to indicate whether transparency is "
"enabled for images in this format. Note: Transparency is not available "
"when IMAGEMODE is RGB, not all formats support transparency. When using "
"transparency, an 8-bit false color image is generated in the transparent "
"areas, so filling other parts of the map with this color will also be "
"transparent, so a suitable color should be used as the background color."
msgstr "透明：使用此参数指示是否为此格式的图像启用透明度。注意：当IMAGEMODE为RGB时，透明度不可用，并非所有格式都支持透明度。使用透明度时，在透明区域会生成8位伪彩色图像，因此用此颜色填充地图的其他部分也将是透明的，因此应使用合适的颜色作为背景颜色。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:311
msgid ""
"FORMATOPTION: optional parameter for driver or format. Zero or more "
"FORMATOPTION can appear in the definition of an OUTPUTFORMAT."
msgstr "FORMATOPTION：驱动程序或格式的可选参数。OUTPUTFORMAT的定义中可以出现零个或多个FORMATOPTION。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:314
msgid ""
"-GD/JPEG: the “QUALITY=n” option can be used to set the generation "
"quality of JPEG images. Values range from 0 to 100. -GD/PNG: “INTERLACE= "
"[ON/OFF]”, which sets whether to render the image interlaced. -GDAL/GIF: "
"“INTERLACE= [ON/OFF]”, which sets whether to render the image interlaced."
" -the parameters supported by GDAL/GTiff:~ are as follows ~ -TILED=YES "
"-BLOCKXSIZE=n -BLOCKYSIZE=n -INTERLEAVE= [PIXEL/BAND] -COMPRESS= "
"[NONE,PACKBITS,JPEG,LZS,DEFAULT]"
msgstr ""
"-gd/jpeg：可以使用“quality=n”选项设置jpeg图像的生成质量。值的范围从0到100。-gd/png：“隔行扫描= "
"[ON/OFF] “，设置是否以隔行扫描的方式呈现图像。-GDAL/GIF：“隔行扫描= [ON/OFF] "
"“，设置是否以隔行扫描的方式呈现图像。-GDAL/GTiff：~支持的参数如下~-TILED=YES-"
"BLOCKXSIZE=n-BLOCKYSIZE=n-交织= [PIXEL/BAND] -压缩= "
"[NONE,PACKBITS,JPEG,LZS,DEFAULT]"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:323
msgid ""
"GDAL: all FORMATOPTION are processed using GDAL. Refer to the GDAL "
"documentation for details. Value: ``[option]`` . If the defined "
"OUTPUTFORMAT is not defined in the MapFile, the program will use it "
"implicitly."
msgstr ""
"GDAL：所有格式操作都使用GDAL进行处理。有关详细信息，请参阅GDAL文档。价值：  ``[option]`` "
"。如果定义的OUTPUTFORMAT未在映射文件中定义，则程序将隐式使用它。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:328
msgid "The following definitions:"
msgstr "以下定义如下："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:330
msgid "Related to the AGG library:"
msgstr "与AGG文库相关："

