msgid "Related to the GD Graphics library:"
msgstr "与GD图形库相关："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:412
msgid "WEB Object"
msgstr "Web对象"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:414
msgid ""
"Defines a parameter for the WEB interface runtime. To ``WEB`` Start with "
"``END`` End."
msgstr "定义Web界面运行时的参数。至  ``WEB`` 开始于  ``END`` 结束。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:417
msgid ""
"IMAGEPATH: The temporary directory where temporary images are stored. It "
"must be available when the WEB server is running. It must start with a "
"slash ``/``. Value: ``[path``"
msgstr "IMAGEPATH：存储临时图像的临时目录。它必须在Web服务器运行时可用。它必须以斜杠开头  ``/`` 。价值：  ``[path``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:421
msgid ""
"IMAGEURL: Virtual path to access temporary images stored under IMAGEPATH."
" Value: ``[url|virtual directory]``"
msgstr "IMAGEURL：访问存储在IMAGEPATH下的临时映像的虚拟路径。价值：  ``[url|virtual directory]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:424
msgid ""
"EMPTY: The URL to redirect to when the query fails. If no value is "
"defined, it will redirect to the URL defined by ~ERROR. Value: ``[url]``"
msgstr "空：查询失败时重定向到的URL。如果未定义任何值，它将重定向到~Error定义的URL。价值：  ``[url]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:428
msgid ""
"ERROR: The URL to which the error occurred. If not defined, MapServer’s "
"error message will be output. Value: ``[url]``"
msgstr "Error：发生错误的URL。如果未定义，将输出MapServer的错误消息。价值：  ``[url]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:431
msgid ""
"LOG: The file that stores the system log, which must be available when "
"the WEB server is running. Value: ``[filename]``"
msgstr "日志：存储系统日志的文件，在Web服务器运行时必须可用。价值：  ``[filename]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:434
msgid ""
"MINSASLE: Minimum scaling. An image of this scale will be returned when "
"the value requested by the user is less than this value. Value: "
"``[double]`` ."
msgstr "MINSASLE：最小伸缩性。当用户请求的值小于该值时，将返回该比例的图像。价值：  ``[double]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:438
msgid ""
"MINTEMPLATE: The template used above the minimum scale, which is useful "
"for nested applications. (Template to be used if above the minimum scale "
"for the app, useful for nesting apps) Value: ``[file|url]``"
msgstr ""
"MINTEMPLATE：在最小比例之上使用的模板，这对于嵌套应用程序很有用。(如果高于应用程序的最小比例，则使用模板，用于嵌套应用程序)值：  "
"``[file|url]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:443
msgid ""
"MAXSCALE: The maximum zoom ratio. An image at this scale will be returned"
" when the user requests a value greater than this value. Value: "
"``[double]`` ."
msgstr "MAXSCALE：最大缩放比。当用户请求大于此值的值时，将返回此比例的图像。价值：  ``[double]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:447
msgid ""
"MAXTEMPLATE: The template used when the maximum scale is above, which is "
"useful for nested applications. (Template to be used if above the maximum"
" scale for the app, useful for nesting apps.) Value: ``[file|url``] ."
msgstr ""
"MAXTEMPLATE：当最大比例大于时使用的模板，这对于嵌套应用程序很有用。(超过应用程序的最大比例时要使用的模板，对于嵌套应用程序很有用。)价值："
"  ``[file|url`` ]。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:452
msgid ""
"TEMPLATE: The template file or URL used to represent the results in "
"interactive mode. Value: ``[file|url]`` ."
msgstr "模板：用于以交互模式表示结果的模板文件或URL。价值：  ``[file|url]`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:455
msgid ""
"HEADER: The template file first sent to the client. Only used in multi-"
"result query mode. (Template to use before everything else has been sent."
" Multiresult query modes only). Value: ``[filename]``"
msgstr ""
"Header：首先发送到客户端的模板文件。仅在多结果查询模式下使用。(在发送其他所有内容之前使用的模板。仅限多结果查询模式)。价值：  "
"``[filename]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:459
msgid ""
"FOOTER: The template file that is finally sent to the client. Only used "
"in multi-result query mode. (Template to use before everything else has "
"been sent. Multiresult query modes only). Value: ``[filename]``"
msgstr ""
"页脚：最终发送到客户端的模板文件。仅在多结果查询模式下使用。(在发送其他所有内容之前使用的模板。仅限多结果查询模式)。价值：  "
"``[filename]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:464
msgid ""
"METADATA: Use this identifier to store arbitrary key-value pairs. Often "
"used when configuring OGC WMS. It is also very flexible when creating "
"templates, and any content entered here can be obtained through template "
"transitions. example:"
msgstr "元数据：使用该标识符来存储任意键-值对。通常在配置OGC WMS时使用。它在创建模板时也非常灵活，此处输入的任何内容都可以通过模板转换获得。示例："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:469
#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec03_lyrobj/section.rst:33
msgid "METADATA title “Map of China” autor “YanMing” END"
msgstr "元数据标题《中国图》作者《燕鸣》完"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:484
msgid "QUERYMAP Object"
msgstr "QUERYMAP对象"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:486
msgid "Define how query results are rendered"
msgstr "定义查询结果的呈现方式"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:488
msgid ""
"COLOR: The color of feature highlighting, the default is yellow. Value: "
"``[r] [g] [b]``"
msgstr "颜色：功能高亮显示的颜色，默认为黄色。价值：  ``[r] [g] [b]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:491
msgid ""
"SIZE: The size of the map, in pixels. The default is the size defined in "
"the MAP object. Value: ``[x][y]``"
msgstr "大小：贴图的大小，以像素为单位。默认大小为贴图对象中定义的大小。价值：  ``[x][y]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:494
msgid "STATUS: Whether to display the map obtained from the query."
msgstr "状态：是否显示查询获取的地图。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:496
msgid ""
"STYLE: Set the realistic way of querying the obtained map. Maps or map "
"parts that are not selected are not processed."
msgstr "Style：设置查询获取地图的逼真方式。不会处理未选择的地图或地图部件。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:499
msgid "Normal: Render the layer in the style of the original layer."
msgstr "法线：以原始层的样式渲染层。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:500
msgid "Hilite: Renders the selected layer using the value of COLOR."
msgstr "Hilite：使用颜色值渲染选定的层。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:501
msgid "Selected: Show only selected layers"
msgstr "选定：仅显示选定的层"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:503
msgid "Value: ``[normal|hilite|selected]``"
msgstr "价值：  ``[normal|hilite|selected]``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:515
msgid "REFERENCE Object reference map"
msgstr "参考对象参考贴图"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:517
msgid "It is a preview showing the location of the map in the main window."
msgstr "它是在主窗口中显示地图位置的预览。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:519
msgid ""
"Begins with a REFERENCE and ends with an END. Three types of reference "
"maps are supported. The most common is to show the extent of the map "
"being interacted with in the preview. It is also possible to include a "
"reference map as part of a query. Point query will generate an icon (an "
"image with a marker) on the query point; face query will highlight the "
"queried area; query given to feature will display the selected part."
msgstr "以引用开始，以结束结束。支持三种类型的参考地图。最常见的是在预览中显示与之交互的地图的范围。也可以将参考地图作为查询的一部分。点查询将在查询点上生成一个图标(带有标记的图像)；面查询将突出显示查询区域；给予特征的查询将显示选定的部分。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:526
msgid ""
"IMAGE: The name of the reference map image (including the path), which "
"can be an absolute or relative path. Value: [path/filename.ext]"
msgstr "图像：参考地图图像的名称(包括路径)，可以是绝对路径或相对路径。价值： [path/filename.ext]"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:529
msgid "SIZE: The pixel size of the reference map image"
msgstr "Size：参考地图图像的像素大小"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:530
msgid ""
"EXTENT: ~The spatial extent of the image. Value: ~[minx] [miny] [maxx] "
"[maxy]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:532
msgid ""
"STATUS: ~Whether to create a ~reference map, the default is OFF. Value: "
"[on \\| off]"
msgstr "状态：~是否创建~引用地图，默认为关闭。价值： [on \\| off]"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:534
msgid ""
"COLOR: The fill color of the corresponding BOX range, the default is red."
" A value of -1 is transparent. Value: [r] [g] [b]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:536
msgid ""
"OUTLINECOLOR: ~ corresponds to the color of the border of ~BOX, the "
"default is black, when the value is -1, there is no border. ~value: ~[r] "
"[g] [b]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:539
msgid ""
"MARKER: The mark displayed when the corresponding range becomes very "
"small (obtained from the symbol file), the default is the cross mark. "
"~value: ~[integer \\| string]"
msgstr "标记：当相应的范围变得很小时显示的标记(从符号文件中获取)，默认为十字标记。~值：~ [integer \\| string]"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:542
msgid ""
"MARKERSIZE: ~ defines the size of the symbol that replaces ~BOX. Value: "
"[integer]"
msgstr "MARKERSIZE：~定义替换~框的符号的大小。价值： [integer]"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:544
msgid ""
"MINBOXSIZE: ~ When ~BOX is smaller than MINBOXSIZE, use MARKER and "
"MARKERSIZE to display. ~value: ~[integer]"
msgstr "MINBOXSIZE：~当~box小于MINBOXSIZE时，使用标记和MARKERSIZE显示。~值：~ [integer]"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:546
msgid ""
"MAXBOXSIZE: When the BOX is larger than MINBOXSIZE, nothing is rendered. "
"Value: [integer]"
msgstr "MAXBOXSIZE：当长方体大于MINBOXSIZE时，不渲染任何内容。价值： [integer]"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:566
msgid "LEGEND Object In MapServer, there are three ways to create legends."
msgstr "对象，有三种方法可以创建图例。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:568
msgid ""
"Simple Image Legends: generate legends just like using a desktop graphics"
" system. This approach is very simple, but it has great limitations."
msgstr "简单图像图例：就像使用桌面图形系统一样生成图例。这种方法非常简单，但也有很大的局限性。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:571
msgid ""
"Legends using HTML templates:~ is a complex way to automatically create "
"legends using ~ MapServer."
msgstr "使用HTML模板的图例：~是使用~MapServer自动创建图例的复杂方法。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:573
msgid ""
